#. module: spp_vocabulary
#: model:spp.vocabulary.code,definition:spp_vocabulary.isco_95
msgid ""
"Street and related sales and service workers sell goods from stalls at "
"markets or on street corners; provide various street services; and collect "
"refuse, recover recyclable material, and sweep streets and similar places."
msgstr ""
"Los vendedores ambulantes y trabajadores de servicios afines venden bienes d"
"esde puestos en mercados o en esquinas de calles; prestan diversos servicios"
" callejeros; y recolectan residuos, recuperan material reciclable y barren c"
